    tags: ["digital legacy", "estate planning", "account management", "preparation"],
    useCase: "When you want to ensure your family can access or manage your digital life if something happens to you.",
    safetyNote: "Store any account lists in a secure location such as a locked safe or encrypted file, never in an unprotected document.",
    iconName: "Lock",
